      <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-navy/70 font-medium text-sm lg:text-base leading-relaxed"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-accent-gold text-lg mt-1">check</span> Yate o velero impecable y lujoso</li>
      <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-navy/70 font-medium text-sm lg:text-base leading-relaxed"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-accent-gold text-lg mt-1">check</span> Servicio todo incluido — barra libre premium y bocadillos locales frescos</li>
